":51.333333333333336,"r":349.3333333333333,"t":554.0},"charspan":[0,105],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/3","text":"Other accounts receivable consist primarily of debit card receivables and third-party credit receivables_"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"Our credit card receivables are restricted under our securitization program. Our Series 2011-1 Class A Notes are secured by 100% of the Nordstrom private label credit card receivables and 90% of the Nordstrom Visa credit card receivables. As of January 31, 2015 and February 1, 2014, our restricted credit card receivables included more receivables than necessary to collateralize our outstanding secured debt and variable funding facilities. As such; can be utilized to increase the current usage of our securitization program. Our credit card securitization agreements set a maximum percentage of receivables that can be associated with various receivable categories; such as employee or foreign receivables; and as of January 31, 2015 and February 1, 2014, these maximums were not exceeded. they","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":460.3333333333333,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":47.666666666666664,"r":556.3333333333334,"t":534.6666666666666},"charspan":[0,798],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/4","text":"Our credit card receivables are restricted under our securitization program. Our Series 2011-1 Class A Notes are secured by 100% of the Nordstrom private label credit card receivables and 90% of the Nordstrom Visa credit card receivables. As of January 31, 2015 and February 1, 2014, our restricted credit card receivables included more receivables than necessary to collateralize our outstanding secured debt and variable funding facilities. As such; can be utilized to increase the current usage of our securitization program. Our credit card securitization agreements set a maximum percentage of receivables that can be associated with various receivable categories; such as employee or foreign receivables; and as of January 31, 2015 and February 1, 2014, these maximums were not exceeded. they"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"Activity in the allowance for credit losses is as follows:","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":439.6666666666667,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":47.666666666666664,"r":247.33333333333334,"t":454.6666666666667},"charspan":[0,58],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/5","text":"Activity in the allowance for credit losses is as follows:"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"Under certain circumstances; we may make modifications to payment terms for a customer experiencing financial difficulties in an effort to help the customer avoid a charge-off or bankruptcy and to maximize our recovery of the outstanding balance: These modifications; which meet the accounting definition of troubled debt restructurings (\"TDRs\")  include reduced or waived fees and finance charges; andlor reduced minimum payments. Receivables classified as TDRs are as follows:","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":288.6666666666667,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":48.0,"r":559.3333333333334,"t":338.3333333333333},"charspan":[0,478],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/6","text":"Under certain circumstances; we may make modifications to payment terms for a customer experiencing financial difficulties in an effort to help the customer avoid a charge-off or bankruptcy and to maximize our recovery of the outstanding balance: These modifications; which meet the accounting definition of troubled debt restructurings (\"TDRs\")  include reduced or waived fees and finance charges; andlor reduced minimum payments. Receivables classified as TDRs are as follows:"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"furniture","label":"page_footer","orig":"48","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":21.0,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":48.666666666666664,"r":59.333333333333336,"t":30.33333333333337},"charspan":[0